    <title>A Note On Square-free Commuting Probabilities of Finite Rings</title>
    <updated>2023-11-01T11:10:07Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2301.02041v2" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2301.02041v2" rel="related" type="application/pdf" title="pdf"/>
    <summary>It is shown that the commuting probability of a finite ring cannot be a fraction with square-free denominator, resolving a conjecture of Buckley and MacHale.</summary>
